	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 20th level, your scoundrel’s cunning has reached its pinnacle. They gain an additional 2d4 of backstab damage and their @UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.6TJ0QdKQq7D2T6eT]{Cunning Strikes} ability improves.</p><p><strong>Blind.</strong> The target is permanently blinded until they receive magical healing.</p><p><strong>Hamstring.</strong> The target’s movement speed becomes 5ft for 1d4 rounds.</p><p><strong>Knockout.</strong> The target falls unconscious for up to 1 minute but may make Constitution saves at the end of each of their turns to awaken early.</p>",
